# Summary
Introduced a non-security UI/backend allowlist mismatch: the newly added VRChat Feedback link cannot be opened through the existing trustedExternalURL policy.
The new auto-capture help text includes a button that calls OpenURL with https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/camera-osc-does-not-work-unless-camera-ui-is-open. OpenURL validates all outbound browser URLs through trustedExternalURL, whose allowlist only includes github.com, hatolife.booth.pm, support.discord.com, and x.com. Because feedback.vrchat.com was not added, the newly introduced button returns an error instead of opening the referenced help page. This is a functional bug in the new guidance, not a security vulnerability.

